| Body | 1rem | 16px | 400 | 1.5 |
| Small | 0.875rem | 14px | 400 | 1.5 |
| Caption | 0.75rem | 12px | 400 | 1.4 |

### Responsive Adjustments
```css
/* Mobile (< 768px) */
h1 { font-size: 2rem; }    /* 32px */
h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }  /* 24px */
h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; } /* 20px */
body { font-size: 1rem; }  /* 16px */

