## Filter Operators

| Operator | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `equals` | Exact match |
| `not` | Not equal |
| `in` | In array |
| `notIn` | Not in array |
| `lt`, `lte` | Less than |
| `gt`, `gte` | Greater than |
| `contains` | String contains |
